{"title": "Vampires before Vellioth", "pageid": 21767, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vampires_before_Vellioth", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Parchment_B_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Book_Parchment_B_Image.png/300px-Book_Parchment_B_Image.png.webp, /w/images/8/87/Book_Parchment_B_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Vampires before Vellioth image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Book_Parchment_B_Image.png/300px-Book_Parchment_B_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Book_Parchment_B_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\">note</a> about the succession of master vampires by <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Incognita\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lady Incognita\">Lady Incognita</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/38px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/50px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Notes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\">Notes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Amanita Szarr\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amanita_Szarr\" title=\"Amanita Szarr\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/25px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/38px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/50px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amanita Szarr\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/25px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amanita_Szarr\" title=\"Amanita Szarr\">Amanita Szarr</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Underneath the stairs leading down to Cazador's coffin inside <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador%27s_Dungeon\" title=\"Cazador's Dungeon\">Cazador's Dungeon</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Our illustrious predecessors, brief notes of the succession of master vampires in Baldur's Gate, by Lady Incognita. \n</p><p><br>\n(All dates Dale Reckoning)\n</p><p><br>\n612-698 - Eravask the Forebear\n</p><p>698-713 - Zholtan Farr the Eviscerator\n</p><p>713-888 - Madame Tallon the Well-Preserved\n</p><p>888-955 - The Interregnum (temporary suppression by Lathanderians)\n</p><p>955-998 - Blaiseuse the Coryphee, who led her spawn in ecstatic blood dances\n</p><p>998-1019 - Dyckson Nightbinder\n</p><p>1019-1019 - Faibleur the Fleeting\n</p><p>1019-1138 - Hideous Gathwycke 'Who Knew Not Satiety'\n</p><p>1138-1204 - Donnela Szarr the Architect, who opened the Tourmaline Depths\n</p><p>1204-1276 - <a href=\"/wiki/Vellioth\" title=\"Vellioth\">Vellioth</a> the Martinet \n</p><p>1276-present - <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\">Cazador Szarr</a> 'The Avid'\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200728\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1046/1000000\nPost‐expa